"007:046 7:47b  In the country round about Jordan did he cast them, in the clay land between Socchoth and Sira.",
"007:047 7:47a There was no reckoning of the brass of which he made all these works, from the very great abundance, there was no end of the weight of the brass.",
"007:048 And king Solomon took the furniture which Chiram made for the house of the Lord, the golden altar, and the golden table of show bread.",
